    "quote": "Consider \\fpltrix run with the time-independent parameters $\\gamma = \\eta m$ and $\\beta d = \\gamma$ (and thus $B = \\log(d/m) - \\log \\eta$). The expected regret of the resulting algorithm satisfies $\\EE{R_T} \\le \\frac{mD}{\\eta} + 3 \\eta m d L_T^* +3m^2 d(D+B) + 3 d.$"
